## Task Ordering Principles

Always respect dependency order when breaking down tasks:

<% if (modules.backend) { %>
1. **Database (migration) before backend** — Models and tables must exist before endpoints can use them.
<% } %>
<% if (modules.backend && (modules.mobile || modules.web)) { %>
2. **Backend (endpoint) before frontend** — API must be available before the UI can consume it.
<% } %>
3. **Integration validated before QA** — End-to-end flow must work before quality review.
4. **Contracts defined before implementation** — API contract before backend starts, component interface before frontend starts.

