## Output Format

Write the plan to `tasks/todo.md` using this structure:

```markdown
## Plan: [feature name]

Date: [date]

### Context

[What is being built and why. Business motivation, user impact, technical drivers.]

### Contracts Defined

**API Contract:**
- `METHOD /api/v1/resource` — description
  - Request: `{ field: type }`
  - Response: `{ field: type }`

**DB Schema:**
- Table/column changes, indexes, constraints

**Component Interface:**
- Component name, props, state shape, data source

### Implementation Steps

- [ ] **[agent]** — [description] — `[directory]` — [S/M/L] — Risks: [risks or none]
- [ ] **[agent]** — [description] — `[directory]` — [S/M/L] — Risks: [risks or none]
- [ ] **[agent]** — [description] — `[directory]` — [S/M/L] — Risks: [risks or none]

### Parallelization

[Which tasks can run in parallel after contracts are locked.]

### Edge Cases to Handle

- [Edge case 1]
- [Edge case 2]

### Definition of Done

[Concrete, testable criteria. Not vague — specific assertions that can be verified.]

### Security Review Needed?

[Yes/No and why. Flag any JWT, auth, permission, or sensitive data changes.]
```

